---
source: crates/orbit/src/app/cli_args.rs
expression: output
---
orbit x.y.z
Extends `docker compose up` and `run` to deploy local config files and
sops-encrypted secrets to a remote host

Usage: orbit [--log-level <LOG_LEVEL>] [--host <HOST>] <SUBCOMMAND>

Commands:
  run   Run a one-off command in a new container on the Docker host.
  up    Create and start containers on the Docker host.
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Flags:
      --log-level <LOG_LEVEL>  Set the log level.
                               [possible values: error, warn, info, debug,
                               trace]
                               [env: ORBIT_LOG_LEVEL]
      --host <HOST>            Docker host to deploy to.

                               Default: `x-orbit.host` in `docker-compose.yml`
  -h, --help                   Print help
  -V, --version                Print version
